# SBK Dashboard Project Rule

Read and follow `/AGENTS.md` and `/docs/AGENT_GUIDE.md` completely before non-trivial work. Treat them as the
canonical source; this file only enables tool discovery.

Keep the Python control plane and native Prometheus/Grafana boundary, fixed/bounded resource model, explicit process
ownership, persistent Prometheus retention, endpoint-scoped dashboards, public/request-host links, CLI compatibility,
and Linux/macOS/Windows support. Validate changes using the commands and completion checklist in `AGENTS.md`.

